ed"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتَعْلَىٰ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":1,"gloss":"to gain the upper hand","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":64,"p":10,"ar":["فَأَجْمِعُوا۟","كَيْدَكُمْ","ثُمَّ","ٱئْتُوا۟","صَفًّا ۚ","وَقَدْ","أَفْلَحَ","ٱلْيَوْمَ","مَنِ","ٱسْتَعْلَىٰ"],"en":"So resolve upon your plan and then come [forward] in line. And he has succeeded today who overcomes"}}],"surahs":[[17,5],[20,5],[3,4],[23,4],[16,3],[27,3],[28,3],[4,2],[6,2],[10,2],[19,2],[30,2],[38,2],[42,2],[44,2],[83,2],[2,1],[5,1],[7,1],[9,1],[11,1],[13,1],[15,1],[22,1],[31,1],[33,1],[34,1],[37,1],[39,1],[40,1],[43,1],[47,1],[53,1],[63,1],[69,1],[72,1],[76,1],[79,1],[87,1],[88,1],[92,1]]}